1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:04,023
Free co-op demo about keeping one
bus running across a wasteland.

2
00:00:04,173 --> 00:00:05,819
And not eating your friends.

3
00:00:05,969 --> 00:00:11,977
There are no roads left, so you make your own.
Someone drives, someone patches the walls from the inside.

4
00:00:12,127 --> 00:00:18,736
Your main tool fires magnetic arrows. Stick one to a wreck,
one to the ground, and drag it out of the way.

5
00:00:18,886 --> 00:00:23,327
Best part:
at the end of the trailer they try to winch the whole bus up a cliff with it.

6
00:00:23,477 --> 00:00:25,776
It explodes. Game over.

7
00:00:25,926 --> 00:00:31,333
The catch? The bus slides around like it weighs nothing,
and the animations are stiff.

8
00:00:31,483 --> 00:00:37,204
The demo is almost four gigs, in fourteen languages,
and the full game lands November third.

9
00:00:37,354 --> 00:00:40,672
Think Pacific Drive,
but the car is a bus and your friends are in it.

10
00:00:40,822 --> 00:00:43,173
Worth a dip. Hold my wheel.

11
00:00:43,323 --> 00:00:44,681
That's Demo Dip.
